        'php_interpreter_missing' => 'An application is set to a PHP version this server does not have installed. OpenLiteSpeed names the lsphp binary by path and does not check it when the configuration is tested, so the application is reported Active and answers 503 on every request. Install that PHP version from the PHP screen, or change the application to a version that is installed.',
        'ols_missing_extuser' => 'Every OpenLiteSpeed application needs its own `extUser`, or it runs as `nobody` and can read every other application\'s files. Re-save the application in the panel to rewrite its vhost.',
        'ols_shared_processor' => 'Two or more OpenLiteSpeed applications define a PHP processor with the same name. OpenLiteSpeed keeps one process per name, so they all run as the first application\'s user and can read each other\'s files. Run `php artisan sites:resync` to give each application its own.',
        'privilege' => 'The panel cannot run commands as root. Check /etc/sudoers.d/ contains the panel grant and that the file passes visudo -c.',
